  "question": {
    "text": "The value of <math><mrow><mrow><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">lim</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></munder></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sec</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sec</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sec</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
